        <p class="sub after">The injury and nature lists fit practice closely. The environmental list is missing common options (the free text is dominated by cold and heat exposure variants and dizziness), and the envenomation free text is mostly unidentified stings and insect stings. The change register already includes option-list and field changes.</p>
